OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAreas of mist and fog across
OL,6,Fthe region, particularly through
OL,7,FCambridgeshire. This slowly lifts and
OL,8,Fclears through the morning to leave a
OL,9,Freasonable afternoon, although the odd
OL,10,Ffog patch may linger. Light winds.
OL,11,FMild where fog clears.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA clear evening with mist and
OL,14,Ffog redeveloping initially in the west
OL,15,Fand becoming widespread by the end of
OL,16,Fthe night. Turning cool under any
OL,17,Fclear spells. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
