OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMist and fog to start across
OL,6,Fthe region, this will lift and clear
OL,7,Fthrough the morning to leave a fine
OL,8,Fafternoon with sunny spells. Feeling
OL,9,Fmild. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,12,Ffurther foggy start with cloud and
OL,13,Fpatchy rain later for Sunday. Fine and
OL,14,Fdry on Monday and Tuesday.
OL,15,FTemperatures around average. Turning
OL,16,Fbreezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
